       "type": "string"
      },
      "validation": {
       "type": "string"
      }
     }
    },
    "header": {
     "type": "object",
     "description": "Header facts read from the text of the action (art_unit, examiner, mail_date, application_number); each has value, how it was found and offsets. Unverified, and used for nothing except this result: no provider or network query and no write is made from them (local read-only database queries only)."
